// ============================================================

/*
Arithmetic:

+   -   *   /   %   **


Assignment:

=   +=   -=   *=   /=   %=   **=


Relational:

<   <=   >   >=   !=   !==   ==   ===


Logical:

&&   ||   !


Bitwise:

&   |   ^   <<   >>   ~
*/


// ============================================================
// IMPORTANT DIFFERENCE
// ============================================================

/*

=      Assignment

==     Loose Equality
       Checks value after type coercion.

===    Strict Equality
       Checks value AND data type.

!=     Loose Not Equal

!==    Strict Not Equal


Example:

10 == "10"      // true

10 === "10"     // false

10 != "10"      // false

10 !== "10"     // true
*/

